* ''No version numbers'' (operator, 2026-11-11, LAW: //"NO version numbers enter our stack ('no global now' no clocks, no scalar-clocks either)."//). A format reads by its shape name, identity by CID, and order by causal link alone: a KEL orders by hash-chain descent with `seq` as a cross-check, a release and an announcement by `prior`, a rotated canon by `rotated-from`. The evergreen witness caps version literals and only lowers the cap. Landed across the clockless sweep (evergreen `version 0/0`).

